      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: golden-girl-meme; hasOverallIntent: non-toxic-humor; overall-intent-description: The image features a smiling elderly woman, Betty White, with the text 'when people ask me who my favorite golden girl is'. The 'Golden Girls' is a popular TV show, and the meme humorously implies that the person is referring to the show's cast. The intent is lighthearted and nostalgic, celebrating the iconic characters and the actress. There is no toxicity, harmful content, or hateful messaging. The humor is based on pop culture reference and affection for the show, not on any disparaging stereotypes or attacks on any group or individual.",
