      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "betty_white",
      "label": "Betty White",
      "description": "An American actress, comedian, and television personality, widely regarded as a cultural icon. She is best known for her roles in 'The Golden Girls' (as Rose Nylund), 'The Mary Tyler Moore Show', and 'Hot in Cleveland'. Her long career and enduring popularity make her a recognizable figure associated with the 'Golden Girls' franchise.",
